AHR tID (23 digits):
YYYYMMDDHHMMSSnnnnnnnnn

Segmentation view:
DATE | TIME | .NANO
YYYYMMDD | HHMMSS | .nnnnnnnnn

Example:
20250117|123045|.123456789
raw: 20250117123045123456789
AHR 23-digit timestamp provides:
YYYY MM DD HH MM SS mmm nnn ppp
2025 01 17 12 30 45 123 456 789
^    ^  ^  ^  ^  ^  ^   ^   ^
|    |  |  |  |  |  |   |   └─ nanoseconds (000-999)
|    |  |  |  |  |  |   └─── microseconds (000-999)  
|    |  |  |  |  |  └───── milliseconds (000-999)
|    |  |  |  |  └─────── seconds (00-59) # divide by 7 frames/sec
|    |  |  |  └───────── minutes (00-59)
|    |  |  └─────────── hours (00-23)
|    |  └───────────── day (01-31)
|    └─────────────── month (01-12)
└────────────────── year (0000-9999)
RE: FPS/s see sh code sh/fps_calc.sh
